  "goodToKnow": "Der Pfad is a narrow path or trail: ein schmaler Pfad, ein Wanderpfad, der Waldpfad. In computing, it's a file path: der Dateipfad. Der Trampelpfad is a desire path, worn by people taking a shortcut across grass. Figuratively, vom rechten Pfad abkommen means to stray from the right path, and ausgetretene Pfade verlassen means to leave the beaten track. Pfadfinder (path-finders) are scouts. Plural: die Pfade."
